# Every text file checks out with LF endings, on every platform.
#
# Some files' bytes are part of what this toolkit hashes or emits: the generated-crate lockfile is
# copied verbatim into every generated crate (and so into its `source_hash` and Wasm build), the
# codegen sources are hashed as the template pack, and the committed generated crates are compared
# byte for byte with codegen output. A CRLF checkout (`core.autocrlf=true`) would change all of
# those for the same spec. The index already holds LF everywhere; this keeps checkouts the same.
* text=auto eol=lf
